    "session_order": "For each run, the named A100 session trains, syncs checkpoints/logs, and self-releases; the executor reads logs/<job>/exit_code from the private Hub and requires 0, verifies the epoch-500 checkpoint is present on the Hub, then creates a separate named CPU session to download, convert, evaluate, upload results/logs, and self-release. A missing/nonzero Hub status or missing checkpoint stops the run and sequential queue.",
